@TokageItLab Oh sorry, to clarify:
A `reset_time : float` parameter would be used to specify the playback position after calling `stop()`.

Currently, the playback position is always set to the start of the section that was being played before `stop()`, regardless of `keep_state`. (The only difference is whether `seek()` is used or not. The playback position is always reset internally) A `reset_time` parameter would allow users to override the position set here.
